          "line_end": 38,
          "line_start": 31,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "herdrdev/herdr",
          "url": "https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/blob/aa961df943b874730b23f78baf94af7332f7acfa/README.md#L31-L38"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_913f405935e90279931d753f9c66e043d53a6f54fc5e6e1438da856627d55e36"
      ],
      "text": "Agents can drive Herdr through a CLI and socket API to spawn panes, prompt each other, and wait until another agent is blocked."
    },
